      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T17:35:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "eqns-\u003ex[i] is defined as double, but isnan and isinf takes input as float (after c++ 11 they take input as double).\n\nUsing isnan or isinf would lead to compiler warning of converting double to float.\nThat\u0027s why I do it this way.",
      "parentUuid": "5bb89b3c_43522f6e",
      "revId": "9a20f32d4394f14fec78f791eeced6787e409f82",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
